# Scratch / working notes (review artifacts versioned in e76d0a1)

# Agent-files convention (see AGENTS.md): .agents/skills/ (skills) and
# .agents/devenv/ (devenv-literacy docs) are tracked, as are AGENTS.md and
# CLAUDE.md. The rest of .agents/ (e.g. .agents/pi/) is platform/tool runtime
# state and stays ignored — .agents/ is dual-use on purpose.
.agents/**
!.agents/skills/
!.agents/skills/**
!.agents/devenv/
!.agents/devenv/**
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
